WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.298
I'm Joy the Promoter.

00:00:02.448 --> 00:00:04.898
I help people find your plugin.

00:00:05.048 --> 00:00:09.058
Once it's published, I promote it in the Plugin Store.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:14.178
Pick where to promote it, like the Store spotlight or social media.

00:00:14.328 --> 00:00:18.698
I draft the posts. You approve every one.

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:21.610
Nothing is posted in this demo.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.891
It's five dollars a month. I can't promise sales.

